you managed to sign a deal.

01:00:39.824 --> 01:00:42.202
Are you paying utilities for them too?

01:00:44.371 --> 01:00:45.455
Oh, okay.

01:00:53.755 --> 01:00:56.508
SALES / LEASING
MANGJIN PLAZA SALES OFFICE

01:01:03.473 --> 01:01:05.308
According to our investigation,

01:01:05.392 --> 01:01:07.143
the sales office
rushed buyers into contracts

01:01:07.227 --> 01:01:09.771
by using development plans
that were not actually approved

01:01:09.854 --> 01:01:13.566
and lured investors with false claims
about confirmed tenants.

01:01:19.447 --> 01:01:20.949
Help me open this!

01:01:21.032 --> 01:01:22.242
Come on!

01:01:51.396 --> 01:01:52.439
MANGJIN PLAZA

01:01:54.024 --> 01:01:55.066
QUICK SALE

01:02:00.989 --> 01:02:02.991
QUICK SALE / ONE-YEAR SHORT-TERM LEASE
URGENT SALE

01:02:04.451 --> 01:02:05.785
QUICK SALE
OFFICE, RETAIL

01:03:02.175 --> 01:03:05.637
THE DREAM LIFE OF MR. KIM

01:03:35.750 --> 01:03:39.295
I told you not to touch
the severance pay!

01:03:39.379 --> 01:03:42.424
Don't try to solve this on your own.
Tell your wife ASAP.

01:03:42.507 --> 01:03:44.175
Are you hiding something?

01:03:44.259 --> 01:03:47.137
You've been acting so strange lately.

01:03:47.220 --> 01:03:49.764
It feels like
I'm interviewing you, Nak-su.

01:03:49.848 --> 01:03:52.016
Can I assume it's settled

01:03:52.100 --> 01:03:54.185
and get started on the work today?

01:03:55.061 --> 01:03:57.689
Hey, Su-gyeom.
How much longer are you going to do this?

01:03:57.772 --> 01:04:00.316
That fence didn't keep you safe.

01:04:00.400 --> 01:04:03.278
Do you know what happens
when you're drowning in debt?

01:04:03.361 --> 01:04:05.488
You end up losing yourself.

01:04:05.572 --> 01:04:06.906
Damn it.

01:04:07.782 --> 01:04:09.409
Who are you?

01:04:09.492 --> 01:04:10.743
Could you be…

01:04:10.827 --> 01:04:13.371
Funny how fate works, isn't it?

01:04:13.455 --> 01:04:14.873
We ended up working together again.

01:04:14.956 --> 01:04:16.958
